### Test scratch binaries

These were interactive probes kept in the module by accident. The durable
checks they approximated are `go test ./internal/storage/s3/...` (object-store
semantics, driven through the real AWS client against `test/s3shim.py`) and
`make e2e` (the Mimir end-to-end run).

*.log
/agent
.claude/
.antigravitycli/
conductor/
/kimistore-agent
/bin/
coverage.out
coverage.html
/tmp-storage-test-wal/
